sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over Product, CN: Pairing failure with specific PairingFailedReason

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, CN: Authentication requirements mismatch
        Product->>CN: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false,<br>reason=authenticationRequirementsNotMet)

        Note over Product: Peer requires higher security level<br>than our IoCapabilities can provide.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, CN: Encryption failed after SMP
        Product->>CN: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)
        Product->>CN: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false,<br>reason=encryptionFailed)

        Note over Product: SMP key exchange succeeded but link-layer<br>encryption setup failed. Connection may drop.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, CN: Re-encryption with stale bond
        Product->>CN: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false,<br>reason=keyRejected)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)

        Note over Product: Stored bond keys no longer accepted by peer.<br>Remove bond and re-pair from scratch.
    end
